  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The fifth term is <math><mn>1</mn></math> . So, <math><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />The <math><msup><mrow><mn>31</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math> term is <math><mo>-</mo><mn>77</mn></math> . So, <math><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>d</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>77</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>26</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>d</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>78</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>17</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>17</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>33</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math>",
